# Sample Mosquitto password file. DO NOT commit a real password_file.
#
# Generate the real file (hashed entries) with mosquitto_passwd, then mount it
# as /mosquitto/config/password_file (the compose bundled-broker profile mounts
# server/mosquitto/password_file read-only). Keep that real file out of git.
#
# Create the server account (must match BOOPBOX_MQTT_USERNAME):
#   mosquitto_passwd -c server/mosquitto/password_file boopbox-server
# Add the seed box account (username = BOOPBOX_SEED_DEVICE_ID, e.g. boop-test):
#   mosquitto_passwd server/mosquitto/password_file boop-test
# Add each additional box by its device id:
#   mosquitto_passwd server/mosquitto/password_file <device-id>
#
# The resulting file looks like (hashes are illustrative placeholders, not real):
# boopbox-server:$7$101$PLACEHOLDER_SERVER_HASH
# boop-test:$7$101$PLACEHOLDER_BOX_HASH
